notes.content:
Hi, this is a patch that brings the following to RAT MEMORY DEMO:

New content:

 Added new controls:
 Dive and go up in water;

 Added accessibility options from the full game:
 Override rat color;
 Change game speed.


Changes:

 Many changes to the forest level (demo 3 level), I also removed shadows in this level;
 Added foliage and more props to the demo 2 level;
 Pressing the reset level button will load the levels faster;
 Added an intro cutscene to the forest level so you can know where are the rats that you have to find;
 Added Playstation buttons to the default controls panel;
 Updated the credits.


Fixes:

 Fixed fur settings;
 Fixed foliage settings (but you need to restart the level to see the changes);
 Fixed texts;
 Better water detection so you can enter and exit it easily;
 Added ground detection so the rat alligns better to the floor;


This is what I can remember, there are also many changes behind the scenes, in things that players can't see.
I hope you have fun, I'm working to release the best 3D Ratformer game I can make.

Hi, this is a patch that brings the following to RAT MEMORY DEMO:

General Improvements:

 Removed the shadows in level 2;
 Better detection to level 3 ending;
 Better water physics detection in level 3;
 Better terrain in level 3.


Fixes:

 Music not playing in main menu and level 3;
 A rock without textures in level 2;
 Ground deforming in level 2;
 Rocks flying in level 3;
 Effects not displaying when talking to npcs in level 3;
 Water appearing below the water in level 3;
 Rocks flying in level 3;


I tested the demo before uploading to steam, but looks like I have to test it in different conditions, as many of these bugs didn't appear to me while testing. I'm sorry for it having many bugs but now I think they are fixed. Anyway, I hope you have fun, and I'm working to have the best 3D Ratformer game I could make.
